OL,3,CNational Motor Museum to leave home to
OL,4,C'secure' long-term future
OL,6,FThe National Motor Museum has
OL,7,Fannounced it will leave its home in
OL,8,Fthe New Forest as part of plans to
OL,9,Fsecure its long-term future.
OL,11,FThe Museum has been based at the
OL,12,FBeaulieu estate, in Hampshire, for 74
OL,13,Fyears, with the terms of its current
OL,14,Flease set to expire in 2030.
OL,16,FTrustees held discussions with the
OL,17,FMontagu family - who own the estate -
OL,18,Fover the past two years on proposals
OL,19,F"focussed on reimagining and
OL,20,Freinvigorating" the museum.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/5
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
