FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786558734
OL,3,CNational Motor Museum to leave home to
OL,4,C'secure' long-term future
OL,6,FIt's now been decided that these
OL,7,Fambitions "can best be achieved
OL,8,Fthrough a move to a new home".
OL,10,FThe new strategy involves developing
OL,11,Fand preserving the museum's collection
OL,12,Fof vintage vehicles, which includes a
OL,13,Fvariety of TV, film and Formula One
OL,14,Fcars, and land speed record breakers.
OL,16,FThere are also plans to build a
OL,17,Ftraining centre for heritage
OL,18,Fengineering apprenticeships.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/5
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
