OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786558734
OL,3,CNational Motor Museum to leave home to
OL,4,C'secure' long-term future
OL,6,FRobert MacGregor, Chair of the Board
OL,7,Fof Trustees of the National Motor
OL,8,FMuseum Trust, said a new home will
OL,9,F"refresh our whole approach, enable us
OL,10,Fto make the collection more
OL,11,Faccessible, expand our educational and
OL,12,Fcommunity impact, and ensure Britain's
OL,13,Fmotoring story remains relevant".
OL,15,F"We are sad that the National Motor
OL,16,FMuseum will be leaving Beaulieu, but
OL,17,Fare at the same time very excited
OL,18,Fabout this once in a generation
OL,19,Fopportunity to transform the Museum
OL,20,Ffor the future," he added.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/5
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
