OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786558734
OL,3,CNational Motor Museum to leave home to
OL,4,C'secure' long-term future
OL,6,FLord Montagu, whose father founded the
OL,7,FNational Motor Museum Trust in 1952,
OL,8,Fsaid the museum's "collections and
OL,9,Factivities have expanded beyond what
OL,10,Fanyone at the time envisaged".
OL,12,FHe said: "The charity's long-term aims
OL,13,Fwill now stand the best chance of
OL,14,Fbeing achieved if it can be based in a
OL,15,Fnew home.
OL,17,F"I remain committed to honouring my
OL,18,Ffather's legacy by continuing to do
OL,19,Fall I can to support the trust."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/5
